    - rid: 5195086324721254400
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'LAN multiplayer screen: button that starts hosting a LAN
          session (verb, imperative). The uGUI panel hard-coded this label unlocalized.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254401
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'LAN multiplayer screen: button that joins the LAN session
          at the entered address (verb, imperative). The uGUI panel hard-coded this
          label unlocalized.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254402
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'LAN multiplayer screen: button that stops the current hosted
          or joined LAN session (verb, imperative). The uGUI panel hard-coded this
          label unlocalized.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254403
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Easter-egg toggle label on the audio settings screen. Swaps
          block break/place cues back to the original synthesized sounds; 'Classic'
          as in retro/original.
    - rid: 5195086324721254404
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Toggle label on the audio settings screen. Enables controller
          vibration feedback; noun, the haptic system as a whole.
    - rid: 5195086324721254405
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Toggle label on the audio settings screen. Silences every
          audio bus while on. 'Mute' is a verb-phrase acting on all sound.
    - rid: 5195086324721254406
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Accessibility toggle label on the audio settings screen. Softens
          bright flashing effects such as lightning; adjective + noun describing
          the resulting mode.
    - rid: 5195086324721254407
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Accessibility/comfort toggle label on the audio settings screen.
          Lowers particle effect density; adjective + noun describing the resulting
          mode.
    - rid: 5195086324721254408
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Group heading on the comfort screen for input-style options
          (handedness, mining input, sprint/crouch toggle modes).
    - rid: 5195086324721254409
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toggle label: stick-click toggles crouch on/off instead of
          the default click-and-hold. Independent of the sprint setting.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254410
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toggle label: smooth/continuous stick locomotion mode. One
          half of a radio pair with Teleport.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254411
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toggle label: makes the left controller the dominant hand.
          Off = right-handed.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254412
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toggle label: tunnel-vision vignette that narrows the view
          during locomotion to reduce motion sickness.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254413
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Slider label: continuous movement speed in metres per second
          while gliding.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254414
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Group heading on the comfort screen for the locomotion controls
          (glide vs teleport, move speed, head-bob).
    - rid: 5195086324721254415
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Group heading on the comfort screen for player height/body
          options (height reset, real-height mode).
    - rid: 5195086324721254416
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toggle label: player collision and view follow their real
          tracked height instead of the fixed in-game player size.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254417
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Button label: recalibrates the player''s standing height
          to their current headset position. Imperative verb.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254418
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toggle label: continuous turning instead of discrete snap
          turns.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254419
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Slider label: continuous turn speed in degrees per second
          (30-180).'
    - rid: 5195086324721254420
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Slider label: the angle in degrees of each discrete snap
          turn (15-90).'
    - rid: 5195086324721254421
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toggle label: stick-click toggles sprint on/off instead of
          the default click-and-hold. Independent of the crouch setting.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254422
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toggle label: automatic assist that lifts a swimmer over
          a low shore edge instead of gravity pulling them back into the water.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254423
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toggle label: while in water and not actively swimming the
          player slowly sinks. Off = neutral buoyancy.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254424
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Slider label: horizontal swim speed as a fraction of walking
          speed (0.30-1.00).'
    - rid: 5195086324721254425
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toggle label: the motion vignette also engages during passive
          underwater descent, not only during driven movement.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254426
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toggle label: teleport locomotion mode (point and blink).
          One half of a radio pair with Glide Motion. Noun, the movement style.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254427
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Comfort settings screen title. Noun phrase heading the VR
          comfort/accessibility options panel.
    - rid: 5195086324721254428
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toggle label: mining input becomes press-once-to-start /
          press-again-to-stop instead of hold-to-mine.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254429
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toggle label: enables a quick 180-degree turn gesture (stick
          pulled back).'
    - rid: 5195086324721254430
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Group heading on the comfort screen for the turn controls
          (smooth turn, snap turn angle, turn-around).
    - rid: 5195086324721254431
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Slider label: size multiplier for the world-space menu panels
          (0.85-1.35).'
    - rid: 5195086324721254432
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Group heading on the comfort screen for the anti-nausea view
          aids (motion vignette and its strength, UI scale).
    - rid: 5195086324721254433
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Slider label directly under the Motion Vignette toggle: how
          strongly the vignette narrows the view (0 = open, 1 = strongest).'
    - rid: 5195086324721254434
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Toggle label: adds a subtle vertical bobbing to glide movement
          to mimic walking. Off = perfectly smooth glide.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254435
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Crafting screen repair button label; byte-parity with the
          uGUI crafting panel's bootstrapper-generated button text, which has no
          table entry today.
    - rid: 5195086324721254436
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: CrateScreen deposit button label (deposits the whole selected-hotbar
          stack into the shared crate). The uGUI panel hardcoded this button text.
    - rid: 5195086324721254437
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: CrateScreen (station_crate) header title. The generated uGUI
          crate panel hardcoded this as scene text.
    - rid: 5195086324721254438
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Section heading on the Creative Tools screen above the time-of-day/day-speed
          sliders and cycle/weather controls.
    - rid: 5195086324721254439
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Section heading on the Creative Tools screen above the fill/replace/delete/copy/paste/undo/redo
          rows.
    - rid: 5195086324721254440
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'LAN multiplayer screen: label on the transport-encryption
          toggle. The parenthetical explains that the server must support TLS for
          the option to work.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254441
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'LAN multiplayer screen: heading above the bookmark rows (servers
          previously joined, most recent first, rejoinable in one tap). The rows
          themselves are addresses/nicknames and stay unlocalized.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254442
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Empty-hotbar selected-block line on the creative hotbar. uGUI
          hard-coded the literal 'No block'.
    - rid: 5195086324721254443
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: 'Canonical 11-line controller mapping copy, byte-equal to
          ControllerMappingText in the bootstrapper. Shared by the controller-mapping
          and controls screens. Keep the line structure; each line is ''control:
          action''.'
    - rid: 5195086324721254444
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World starting-biome value label; humanize-fallback parity
          for canonical id 'balanced'.
    - rid: 5195086324721254445
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World game-mode value label; humanize-fallback parity
          for canonical id 'creative'.
    - rid: 5195086324721254446
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World starting-biome value label; humanize-fallback parity
          for canonical id 'drybrush'.
    - rid: 5195086324721254447
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World starting-biome value label; humanize-fallback parity
