    - rid: 5195086324721254450
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World difficulty value label; humanize-fallback parity
          for canonical id 'hard'.
    - rid: 5195086324721254451
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World starting-biome value label; humanize-fallback parity
          for canonical id 'highlands'.
    - rid: 5195086324721254452
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World starting-biome value label; humanize-fallback parity
          for canonical id 'meadow'.
    - rid: 5195086324721254453
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World difficulty value label; humanize-fallback parity
          for canonical id 'normal'.
    - rid: 5195086324721254454
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World starting-biome value label; humanize-fallback parity
          for canonical id 'pinewild'.
    - rid: 5195086324721254455
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World game-mode value label; humanize-fallback parity
          for canonical id 'survival'.
    - rid: 5195086324721254456
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World world-preset value label; humanize-fallback parity
          for canonical id 'survival_terrain'.
    - rid: 5195086324721254457
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World starting-biome value label; humanize-fallback parity
          for canonical id 'tundra'.
    - rid: 5195086324721254459
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World starting-biome value label; humanize-fallback parity
          for canonical id 'wetland'.
    - rid: 5195086365795287040
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Gameplay HUD vital label, beside a meter and a number. Noun,
          not a verb. The label column is about 110 px wide, so a long translation
          clips rather than wraps.
    - rid: 5195086365795287041
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Gameplay HUD vital label. The player's need for food, not
          their appetite. Same 110 px width constraint as Health.
    - rid: 5195086365795287042
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Marker beside a gameplay HUD vital below a quarter - the more
          urgent partner of the low marker, and it must read as MORE severe than
          that one. Same one-to-two character ASCII constraint.
    - rid: 5195086365795287043
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: One-character marker beside a gameplay HUD vital that has
          fallen below half. It exists so the warning does not depend on colour alone.
          Keep to one or two characters and prefer ASCII - it must render in every
          locale's font.
    - rid: 5195086365795287044
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Gameplay HUD vital label. The exertion budget sprinting and
          harvesting consume. Same 110 px width constraint.
    - rid: 5195086365795287045
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Gameplay HUD vital label. The player's need for water. Same
          110 px width constraint.
    - rid: 5195086366323769344
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Settings row that turns the diagnostic readout ON when pressed.
          The label states the CURRENT state, not the action.
    - rid: 5195086366323769345
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Settings row that turns the diagnostic readout OFF when pressed
          - the label states the CURRENT state, not the action, matching how the
          other stateful rows in this game read. 'Debug Overlay' is the developer-facing
          readout of position, biome, weather and frame time.
    - rid: 5195086366521688064
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle shown when another player joins the session. A full
          sentence with a period, matching the other subtitle lines. 'Player' is
          any other person in the session, not a role or class.
    - rid: 5195086366521688065
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: Subtitle shown when another player leaves the session, whether
          deliberately or by disconnecting. Full sentence with a period.
    - rid: 5195086370520956928
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: "Toggle label: a small static dot at the centre of vision
          that gives the eye a fixed reference during continuous locomotion, reducing
          motion sickness. Not an aiming reticle \u2014 this game aims with the controller
          ray."
    - rid: 5195086375790575616
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World world-size value label for the 384x384 bounded world.
    - rid: 5195086375790575617
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: New World world-size value label for the 512x512 bounded world.
